From: Yan <superwhisz@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 18:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft perf-engine P2 excess falling-block sweeper

Wires the SourbyCraftConfig.maxFallingBlockPerChunk knob that was
defined but unread. Every 40 ticks (2s), each falling block counts
siblings in its chunk via getEntitiesOfClass and discards itself if
the count exceeds the limit. Cascading discards bring count under
limit across consecutive sweep ticks.

Falling blocks are short-lived (~80 ticks typical), so the 40-tick
gate fires roughly twice per entity. Same chunk-AABB pattern as
0037 minecart/boat sweeper.

Blocks the sand-cascade lag-machine pattern where TNT or piston
triggers thousands of FallingBlockEntities in one chunk.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/FallingBlockEntity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/FallingBlockEntity.java
index 045ce9c..c9e5480 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/FallingBlockEntity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/FallingBlockEntity.java
@@ -147,6 +147,24 @@ public class FallingBlockEntity extends Entity {

     @Override
     public void tick() {
+        // SourbyCraft start - perf-engine P2 lag-machine: excess falling-block sweeper
+        if (!this.level().isClientSide()
+            && this.tickCount > 0
+            && this.tickCount % 40 == 0) {
+            int limit = dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.SourbyCraftConfig.maxFallingBlockPerChunk;
+            if (limit > 0) {
+                net.minecraft.world.level.ChunkPos cp = this.chunkPosition();
+                net.minecraft.world.phys.AABB chunkBox = new net.minecraft.world.phys.AABB(
+                    cp.getMinBlockX(), this.level().getMinY(), cp.getMinBlockZ(),
+                    cp.getMaxBlockX() + 1, this.level().getMaxY() + 1, cp.getMaxBlockZ() + 1);
+                int count = this.level().getEntitiesOfClass(FallingBlockEntity.class, chunkBox, e -> true).size();
+                if (count > limit) {
+                    this.discard(org.bukkit.event.entity.EntityRemoveEvent.Cause.DESPAWN);
+                    return;
+                }
+            }
+        }
+        // SourbyCraft end - perf-engine P2 lag-machine
         if (this.blockState.isAir()) {
             this.discard(org.bukkit.event.entity.EntityRemoveEvent.Cause.DESPAWN); // CraftBukkit - add Bukkit remove cause
         } else {
